<title>UK: Ashanti names Morrell non-exec director.</title>
<headline>Ashanti names Morrell non-exec director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghanaian gold miner Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd said on Friday it named Lonrho Plc chief executive Nicholas Morrell as a non-executive director of the company.</p>
<p>The appointment would mean that Morrell would sit on the board, with ousted Lonrho founder Tiny Rowland, also a non-executive director of Ashanti.</p>
<p>Lonrho owns 33.3 percent of Ashanti.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
